accessible class net/minecraft/client/gui/components/toasts/ToastManager$ToastInstance
extendable class net/minecraft/client/gui/components/toasts/ToastManager$ToastInstance
accessible method net/minecraft/client/gui/components/toasts/ToastManager$ToastInstance <init> (Lnet/minecraft/client/gui/components/toasts/ToastManager;Lnet/minecraft/client/gui/components/toasts/Toast;II)V

accessible field net/minecraft/client/gui/components/toasts/ToastManager$ToastInstance firstSlotIndex I
accessible field net/minecraft/client/gui/components/toasts/ToastManager$ToastInstance occupiedSlotCount I
accessible field net/minecraft/client/gui/components/toasts/ToastManager$ToastInstance animationStartTime J
accessible field net/minecraft/client/gui/components/toasts/ToastManager$ToastInstance becameFullyVisibleAt J
accessible field net/minecraft/client/gui/components/toasts/ToastManager$ToastInstance visibility Lnet/minecraft/client/gui/components/toasts/Toast$Visibility;
accessible field net/minecraft/client/gui/components/toasts/ToastManager$ToastInstance fullyVisibleFor J
accessible field net/minecraft/client/gui/components/toasts/ToastManager$ToastInstance visiblePortion F
accessible field net/minecraft/client/gui/components/toasts/ToastManager$ToastInstance hasFinishedRendering Z
